rom your kids  was unwavering i love you and thank you  is there any message that you want to  give him that you're hoping to get to  him  yeah and just like ryan we love you  remington loves you  all of the dogs love you please please  please pull through this  oh my gosh i'm so sorry this is i i  i can't imagine um what this must be  like for you  how are you doing good i mean yeah i  mean i just can't  believe that this is what the world has  become it's really sad  over the weekend the singer's rep  confirmed to et that gaga's stolen  frenchies had been returned  it is unknown if the person received the  500 000  reward money gaga offered during the  search
 

